      ],
      "behavior": "Actual Help/debug/network action opens the exact URL prompt, admits ordinary NetEngine GET with saved cookies/headers/bandwidth and accounting, shows real Working progress, supports native popup stop\u2192actual Job cancellation, and finishes the progress card on a three-second stored deadline. Each overlapping request/result is captured by stable per-binding identity. Success asks the exact byte-length question with save-to-file/copy-to-clipboard/forget; saves raw response bytes and copies charset-decoded text. Input Cancel, response forget, HTTP error/cancel and file-picker cancellation are meaningful consumers. Visible/current child and Main question guards reject stale/direct callbacks; saved bytes are revalidated after picker return. Existing admitted hidden work still delivers a result question, but hidden new launch is refused. Rebind/accepted exit/final Bound clone drop/Main destruction permanently cancel jobs and hide children through weak callbacks/timers, without affecting Cancel-exit.",
